{"714680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Citadels", "steam_appid": 714680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citadels is an immersive PvPvE tactical extraction FPS for 12 squads of 3. Raid a Citadel on the dead world of Ortus. Climb floor by floor as rival squads hunt what you carry. Get out with your loot, or lose everything to your second death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You embody a Revenant, an elite, genetically enhanced warriors, navigating a world torn by endless wars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/ee7e3030e33527ad1ad03a7d9dfa5981.poster.avif?t=1786967032\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/ee7e3030e33527ad1ad03a7d9dfa5981.webm?t=1786967032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/ee7e3030e33527ad1ad03a7d9dfa5981.mp4?t=1786967032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set against the backdrop of the Citadel and the rugged landscapes of Ortus, the game challenges players to confront moral choices and survive relentless battles. Created by Black Ice Studios, a team of gamers, ex-military, and industry veterans based in Canada, this game combines hardcore realism with lore-rich storytelling to deliver an experience that almost feels like a survival simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/aa7b7ad87b7c04b99382fa003527aa44.poster.avif?t=1786967032\" width=1170 height=327 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/aa7b7ad87b7c04b99382fa003527aa44.webm?t=1786967032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashes of Mankind delivers intense, tactical FPS gameplay built by gamers, for gamers. Featuring a mix of extraction-based gameplay, first-person immersion, and unforgiving realism, this game emphasizes skill and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/ece9006bcb6bdb74d01a3df16d72898c.avif?t=1786967032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras_big/ece9006bcb6bdb74d01a3df16d72898c.avif?t=1786967032 width=1560 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/bb0241a086e998e1942d092154d4db16.poster.avif?t=1786967032\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/bb0241a086e998e1942d092154d4db16.webm?t=1786967032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714680/extras/bb0241a086e998e1942d092154d4db16.mp4?t=1786967032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citadels is an immersive PvPvE tactical extraction FPS for 12 squads of 3. Raid a Citadel on the dead world of Ortus. Climb floor by floor as rival squads hunt what you carry. Get out with your loot, or lose everything to your second death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You embody a Revenant, an elite, genetically enhanced warriors, navigating a world torn by endless wars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><sp